g cankers, leaf spots, overgrowths, scabs, \nwilts, and others</span></span></p>\n<ul class=\"images\">\n<li>\n<img src=\"anthra1/cankerleavess.jpg\" width=\"150\" height=\"79\" alt=\"cancker\" style=\"left: 0px; top: 0px\"></li>\n\t<li></li>\n<li>\n<img src=\"anthra1/redrust1s.jpg\" width=\"150\" height=\"95\" alt=\"Other\" style=\"left: 0px; top: 0px\"></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"auto-style9\"><span lang=\"en-in\" class=\"auto-style8\"><strong>Others:</strong> <span>This disease attack can \ncauses reduction in photosynthetic activity and defoliation of leaves thereby \nreducing the vitality of the host plant.</span></span></p>\n</article><!--cutoutright-->\n<!--END OF CUTOUT BOX-->\n\n<!--a sub heading and some content-->\n<h3 class=\"auto-style7\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span lang=\"en-in\">Fungal Diseases \n- <span class=\"auto-style14\"> \n\t\tBlossom blight </span> </span></h3>\n\t\t<p class=\"auto-style10\"><strong>Associated pathogens:</strong></p>\n\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"auto-style10\"><span class=\"auto-style10\"><em><strong>C. \n\t\t\tgloeosporiodes</strong></em></span></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"auto-style10\"><span class=\"auto-style10\"><em><strong>\n\t\t\tAlternaria alternata</strong></em></span></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"auto-style10\"><span class=\"auto-style10\"><strong><em>\n\t\t\tPestaliopsis mangiferae</em></strong></span></p>\n\t\t</div>\n<!--another sub heading and content relating to that-->\n<h4 class=\"auto-style2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Blossom blight at various parts of mango</h4>\n\t\t<p class=\"auto-style2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Move mouse over the image to view more details:</p>\n<ul class=\"images-enlarge\" style=\"height: 203px; width: 568px;\"> <!-- Images enlarge on hover, see   for an explanation-->\n<li><a href=\"anthra1/blosumblight1.jpg\">\n<img src=\"anthra1/blosumblight1s.jpg\" width=\"150\" height=\"95\" alt=\"Blossom blight (thumbnail)\"></a><a><span><